  "body": "- Added safe USB drive ejection from the web interface.\r\n- Enabled library scans and operations on other games during gameplay while protecting the active game.\r\n- Fixed SMB guest connections and added a guest/authenticated access switch.\r\n- Added a read-only mode for SMB connections.\r\n- Removed forced closure of FPKG games when entering Rest Mode.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/drakmor/ShadowMountPlus/compare/1.7beta9...1.7beta10",
